  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - Colombia and Haiti Port Security Technologies and VTM Information Systems, through Meridian International Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $342,128 Colombia and Haiti Port Security Technologies and VTM Information Systems Reverse Trade Mission brings officials from Colombia and Haiti to the U.S. to familiarize them with the latest available VTMIS and port security system technologies. The visits include meetings with U.S. suppliers as well as site visits to U.S. ports with important VTMIS and port security operations.</narrative>
  </description>
